{"parents": [{"link": "../../", "title": "Module code"}], "title": "docworm.client", "body": "<h1>Source code for docworm.client</h1><div class=\"highlight\"><pre>\n<span></span><span class=\"sd\">\"\"\"</span>\n<span class=\"sd\">DocWorm Python SDK (0.6.1).</span>\n\n<span class=\"sd\">Thin client over the DocWorm REST API plus the chat streams (WebSocket and</span>\n<span class=\"sd\">SSE). Covers documents, chats, reasoning RAG queries, codegen, tables, models,</span>\n<span class=\"sd\">and titles.</span>\n\n<span class=\"sd\">Canonical identifiers are file_id (document) and chat_id (chat).</span>\n<span class=\"sd\">Chat streaming is available over WebSocket (chat_stream) and over SSE</span>\n<span class=\"sd\">(chat_stream_sse) for deployments where a WebSocket upgrade is unavailable.</span>\n\n<span class=\"sd\">Configuration priority (highest first):</span>\n<span class=\"sd\">  1. Constructor arguments</span>\n<span class=\"sd\">  2. Environment variables (DOCWORM_API_KEY, DOCWORM_URL)</span>\n<span class=\"sd\">  3. config.yaml file (optional, see project root)</span>\n\n<span class=\"sd\">Auth accepts a DocWorm API key (dw_live_...), sent as ``X-API-KEY: &lt;key&gt;``</span>\n<span class=\"sd\">with no Authorization header, or a bearer token, sent as</span>\n<span class=\"sd\">``Authorization: Bearer &lt;token&gt;``.</span>\n<span class=\"sd\">\"\"\"</span>\n\n<span class=\"kn\">import</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">json</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">import</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">logging</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">import</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">os</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">typing</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"n\">Any</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"n\">AsyncGenerator</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"n\">BinaryIO</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"n\">Optional</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"n\">Union</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">urllib.parse</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"n\">quote</span>\n\n<span class=\"kn\">import</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">httpx</span>\n\n<span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">.config</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"n\">load_config</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">.models</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"p\">(</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">ChatAttachment</span><span class=\"p\">,</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">ChatEvent</span><span class=\"p\">,</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">ChatInfo</span><span class=\"p\">,</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">CitedNode</span><span class=\"p\">,</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">CodegenResponse</span><span class=\"p\">,</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">DocumentStatus</span><span class=\"p\">,</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">ExcelSheetPreview</span><span class=\"p\">,</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">IndexResponse</span><span class=\"p\">,</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">Message</span><span class=\"p\">,</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">PageContent</span><span class=\"p\">,</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">PageInfo</span><span class=\"p\">,</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">QueryResponse</span><span class=\"p\">,</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">Skill</span><span class=\"p\">,</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">TreeNode</span><span class=\"p\">,</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">UploadResponse</span><span class=\"p\">,</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">UsageInfo</span><span class=\"p\">,</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">_usage_from_dict</span><span class=\"p\">,</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">cited_node_from_dict</span><span class=\"p\">,</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">document_status_from_dict</span><span class=\"p\">,</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">message_from_dict</span><span class=\"p\">,</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">tree_node_from_dict</span><span class=\"p\">,</span>\n<span class=\"p\">)</span>\n\n<span class=\"n\">logger</span> <span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"n\">logging</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">getLogger</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"vm\">__name__</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n\n<span class=\"c1\"># Terminal statuses on the file row \u2014 wait_for_indexing stops polling.</span>\n<span class=\"n\">_SUCCESS_STATUSES</span> <span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"s2\">\"ready\"</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"s2\">\"completed\"</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"s2\">\"indexed\"</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n<span class=\"n\">_FAILED_STATUSES</span> <span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"s2\">\"error\"</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"s2\">\"failed\"</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"s2\">\"cancelled\"</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n\n\n<span class=\"k\">def</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nf\">_normalize_chat_data</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">data</span><span class=\"p\">:</span> <span class=\"n\">Any</span><span class=\"p\">)</span> <span class=\"o\">-&gt;</span> <span class=\"nb\">dict</span><span class=\"p\">:</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"sd\">\"\"\"Normalize a WS/SSE ``data`` payload to a dict.</span>\n\n<span class=\"sd\">    The backend may deliver data as an object or as a JSON string.</span>\n<span class=\"sd\">    \"\"\"</span>\n    <span class=\"k\">if</span> <span class=\"nb\">isinstance</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">data</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"nb\">dict</span><span class=\"p\">):</span>\n        <span class=\"k\">return</span> <span class=\"n\">data</span>\n    <span class=\"k\">if</span> <span class=\"nb\">isinstance</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">data</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"nb\">str</span><span class=\"p\">):</span>\n        <span class=\"k\">try</span><span class=\"p\">:</span>\n            <span class=\"n\">parsed</span> <span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"n\">json</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">loads</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">data</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n            <span class=\"k\">return</span> <span class=\"n\">parsed</span> <span class=\"k\">if</span> <span class=\"nb\">isinstance</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">parsed</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"nb\">dict</span><span class=\"p\">)</span> <span class=\"k\">else</span> <span class=\"p\">{}</span>\n        <span class=\"k\">except</span> <span class=\"n\">json</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">JSONDecodeError</span><span class=\"p\">:</span>\n            <span class=\"k\">return</span> <span class=\"p\">{}</span>\n    <span class=\"k\">return</span> <span class=\"p\">{}</span>\n\n\n<span class=\"k\">def</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nf\">_map_chat_event</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">event</span><span class=\"p\">:</span> <span class=\"nb\">str</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"n\">data</span><span class=\"p\">:</span> <span class=\"n\">Any</span><span class=\"p\">)</span> <span class=\"o\">-&gt;</span> <span class=\"n\">Optional</span><span class=\"p\">[</span><span class=\"n\">ChatEvent</span><span class=\"p\">]:</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"sd\">\"\"\"Map a backend chat event (WS or SSE) to a ChatEvent.</span>\n\n<span class=\"sd\">    Shared by the WebSocket and SSE transports; returns None for</span>\n<span class=\"sd\">    liveness/housekeeping events that are not surfaced.</span>\n<span class=\"sd\">    \"\"\"</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">d</span> <span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"n\">_normalize_chat_data</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">data</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">text</span> <span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"n\">d</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">get</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"s2\">\"text\"</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"s2\">\"\"</span><span class=\"p\">)</span> <span class=\"k\">if</span> <span class=\"nb\">isinstance</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">d</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">get</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"s2\">\"text\"</span><span class=\"p\">),</span> <span class=\"nb\">str</span><span class=\"p\">)</span> <span class=\"k\">else</span> <span class=\"s2\">\"\"</span>\n\n    <span class=\"k\">if</span> <span class=\"n\">event</span> <span class=\"o\">==</span> <span class=\"s2\">\"thinking_chunk\"</span> <span class=\"ow\">or</span> <span class=\"n\">event</span> <span class=\"o\">==</span> <span class=\"s2\">\"thought\"</span><span class=\"p\">:</span>\n        <span class=\"k\">return</span> <span class=\"n\">ChatEvent</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"nb\">type</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"s2\">\"thinking\"</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"n\">text</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"n\">text</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"n\">data</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"n\">d</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n    <span class=\"k\">if</span> <span class=\"n\">event</span> <span class=\"o\">==</span> <span class=\"s2\">\"answer_chunk\"</span><span class=\"p\">:</span>\n        <span class=\"k\">return</span> <span class=\"n\">ChatEvent</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"nb\">type</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"s2\">\"answer\"</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"n\">text</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"n\">text</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"n\">data</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"n\">d</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n    <span class=\"k\">if</span> <span class=\"n\">event</span> <span class=\"o\">==</span> <span class=\"s2\">\"status_chunk\"</span><span class=\"p\">:</span>\n        <span class=\"k\">return</span> <span class=\"n\">ChatEvent</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"nb\">type</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"s2\">\"status\"</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"n\">text</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"n\">text</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"n\">data</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"n\">d</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n    <span class=\"k\">if</span> <span class=\"n\">event</span> <span class=\"o\">==</span> <span class=\"s2\">\"citation\"</span><span class=\"p\">:</span>\n        <span class=\"n\">cit</span> <span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"n\">d</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">get</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"s2\">\"citation\"</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"n\">d</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n        <span class=\"n\">citation</span> <span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"n\">cited_node_from_dict</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">cit</span> <span class=\"k\">if</span> <span class=\"nb\">isinstance</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">cit</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"nb\">dict</span><span class=\"p\">)</span> <span class=\"k\">else</span> <span class=\"p\">{})</span>\n        <span class=\"k\">return</span> <span class=\"n\">ChatEvent</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"nb\">type</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"s2\">\"citation\"</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"n\">citation</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"n\">citation</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"n\">data</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"n\">d</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n    <span class=\"k\">if</span> <span class=\"n\">event</span> <span class=\"ow\">in</span> <span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"s2\">\"action_start\"</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"s2\">\"action_complete\"</span><span class=\"p\">):</span>\n        <span class=\"k\">return</span> <span class=\"n\">ChatEvent</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"nb\">type</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"s2\">\"action\"</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"n\">text</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"n\">text</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"n\">data</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"n\">d</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n    <span class=\"k\">if</span> <span class=\"n\">event</span> <span class=\"ow\">in</span> <span class=\"p\">(</span>\n        <span class=\"s2\">\"trace_group\"</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"s2\">\"trace_group_end\"</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"s2\">\"trace_item\"</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"s2\">\"trace_item_update\"</span><span class=\"p\">,</span>\n        <span class=\"s2\">\"thinking_phase_start\"</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"s2\">\"thinking_phase_end\"</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"s2\">\"nodes_selected\"</span><span class=\"p\">,</span>\n        <span class=\"s2\">\"selected_sections\"</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"s2\">\"files_read\"</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"s2\">\"entity_discovered\"</span><span class=\"p\">,</span>\n        <span class=\"s2\">\"subtasks_declared\"</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"s2\">\"subtask_start\"</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"s2\">\"subtask_action\"</span><span class=\"p\">,</span>\n        <span class=\"s2\">\"subtask_complete\"</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"s2\">\"compaction\"</span><span class=\"p\">,</span>\n    <span class=\"p\">):</span>\n        <span class=\"k\">return</span> <span class=\"n\">ChatEvent</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"nb\">type</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"s2\">\"trace\"</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"n\">text</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"n\">text</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"n\">data</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"n\">d</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n    <span class=\"k\">if</span> <span class=\"n\">event</span> <span class=\"o\">==</span> <span class=\"s2\">\"plan_update\"</span><span class=\"p\">:</span>\n        <span class=\"k\">return</span> <span class=\"n\">ChatEvent</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"nb\">type</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"s2\">\"plan\"</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"n\">data</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"n\">d</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n    <span class=\"k\">if</span> <span class=\"n\">event</span> <span class=\"o\">==</span> <span class=\"s2\">\"todo_updated\"</span><span class=\"p\">:</span>\n        <span class=\"k\">return</span> <span class=\"n\">ChatEvent</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"nb\">type</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"s2\">\"todo\"</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"n\">data</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"n\">d</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n    <span class=\"k\">if</span> <span class=\"n\">event</span> <span class=\"o\">==</span> <span class=\"s2\">\"traversal\"</span><span class=\"p\">:</span>\n        <span class=\"k\">return</span> <span class=\"n\">ChatEvent</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"nb\">type</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"s2\">\"traversal\"</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"n\">text</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"n\">text</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"n\">data</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"n\">d</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n    <span class=\"k\">if</span> <span class=\"n\">event</span> <span class=\"ow\">in</span> <span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"s2\">\"artifact_card\"</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"s2\">\"artifact.ready\"</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"s2\">\"artifact.created\"</span><span class=\"p\">):</span>\n        <span class=\"k\">return</span> <span class=\"n\">ChatEvent</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"nb\">type</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"s2\">\"artifact\"</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"n\">data</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"n\">d</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n    <span class=\"k\">if</span> <span class=\"n\">event</span> <span class=\"ow\">in</span> <span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"s2\">\"prediction_viz\"</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"s2\">\"excel_viz\"</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"s2\">\"viz\"</span><span class=\"p\">):</span>\n        <span class=\"k\">return</span> <span class=\"n\">ChatEvent</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"nb\">type</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"s2\">\"viz\"</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"n\">data</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"n\">d</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n    <span class=\"k\">if</span> <span class=\"n\">event</span> <span class=\"o\">==</span> <span class=\"s2\">\"graph_status\"</span><span class=\"p\">:</span>\n        <span class=\"k\">return</span> <span class=\"n\">ChatEvent</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"nb\">type</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"s2\">\"graph\"</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"n\">text</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"n\">text</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"n\">data</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"n\">d</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n    <span class=\"k\">if</span> <span class=\"n\">event</span> <span class=\"o\">==</span> <span class=\"s2\">\"work_completed\"</span><span class=\"p\">:</span>\n        <span class=\"k\">return</span> <span class=\"n\">ChatEvent</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"nb\">type</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"s2\">\"work_completed\"</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"n\">data</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"n\">d</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n    <span class=\"k\">if</span> <span class=\"n\">event</span> <span class=\"o\">==</span> <span class=\"s2\">\"interrupted\"</span><span class=\"p\">:</span>\n        <span class=\"k\">return</span> <span class=\"n\">ChatEvent</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"nb\">type</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"s2\">\"interrupted\"</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"n\">data</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"n\">d</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n    <span class=\"k\">if</span> <span class=\"n\">event</span> <span class=\"o\">==</span> <span class=\"s2\">\"done\"</span><span class=\"p\">:</span>\n        <span class=\"k\">return</span> <span class=\"n\">ChatEvent</span><span class=\"p\">(</span>\n            <span class=\"nb\">type</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"s2\">\"done\"</span><span class=\"p\">,</span>\n            <span class=\"n\">msg_id</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"n\">d</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">get</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"s2\">\"msg_id\"</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"s2\">\"\"</span><span class=\"p\">),</span>\n            <span class=\"n\">usage</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"n\">_usage_from_dict</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">d</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">get</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"s2\">\"usage\"</span><span class=\"p\">)),</span>\n            <span class=\"n\">data</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"n\">d</span><span class=\"p\">,</span>\n        <span class=\"p\">)</span>\n    <span class=\"k\">if</span> <span class=\"n\">event</span> <span class=\"o\">==</span> <span class=\"s2\">\"error\"</span><span class=\"p\">:</span>\n        <span class=\"n\">err</span> <span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"n\">d</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">get</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"s2\">\"error\"</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"s2\">\"\"</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n        <span class=\"k\">return</span> <span class=\"n\">ChatEvent</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"nb\">type</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"s2\">\"error\"</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"n\">error</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"n\">err</span> <span class=\"k\">if</span> <span class=\"nb\">isinstance</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">err</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"nb\">str</span><span class=\"p\">)</span> <span class=\"k\">else</span> <span class=\"nb\">str</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">err</span><span class=\"p\">),</span> <span class=\"n\">data</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"n\">d</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n    <span class=\"c1\"># Liveness/housekeeping: thinking_start, working_start,</span>\n    <span class=\"c1\"># status_heartbeat, ping \u2014 not surfaced.</span>\n    <span class=\"k\">return</span> <span class=\"kc\">None</span>\n\n\n<div class=\"viewcode-block\" id=\"DocWorm\">\n<a class=\"viewcode-back\" href=\"../../../client/#docworm.client.DocWorm\">[docs]</a>\n<span class=\"k\">class</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nc\">DocWorm</span><span class=\"p\">:</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"sd\">\"\"\"</span>\n<span class=\"sd\">    SDK client for the DocWorm service.</span>\n\n<span class=\"sd\">    Args:</span>\n<span class=\"sd\">        base_url: DocWorm service URL (default: DOCWORM_URL env &gt; config.yaml &gt; hosted).</span>\n<span class=\"sd\">        api_key: DocWorm API key, dw_live_... (default: DOCWORM_API_KEY env &gt; config.yaml).</span>\n\n<span class=\"sd\">    Usage:</span>\n<span class=\"sd\">        client = DocWorm(api_key=\"...\")</span>\n<span class=\"sd\">        upload = client.upload(\"report.pdf\")</span>\n<span class=\"sd\">        client.index(upload.file_id)</span>\n<span class=\"sd\">        status = client.wait_for_indexing(upload.file_id)</span>\n<span class=\"sd\">    \"\"\"</span>\n\n    <span class=\"k\">def</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"fm\">__init__</span><span class=\"p\">(</span>\n        <span class=\"bp\">self</span><span class=\"p\">,</span>\n        <span class=\"n\">base_url</span><span class=\"p\">:</span> <span class=\"n\">Optional</span><span class=\"p\">[</span><span class=\"nb\">str</span><span class=\"p\">]</span> <span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"kc\">None</span><span class=\"p\">,</span>\n        <span class=\"n\">api_key</span><span class=\"p\">:</span> <span class=\"n\">Optional</span><span class=\"p\">[</span><span class=\"nb\">str</span><span class=\"p\">]</span> <span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"kc\">None</span><span class=\"p\">,</span>\n    <span class=\"p\">):</span>\n        <span class=\"n\">cfg</span> <span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"n\">load_config</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">api_key</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"n\">api_key</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"n\">base_url</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"n\">base_url</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n        <span class=\"bp\">self</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">base_url</span> <span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"n\">cfg</span><span class=\"p\">[</span><span class=\"s2\">\"base_url\"</span><span class=\"p\">]</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">rstrip</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"s2\">\"/\"</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n        <span class=\"bp\">self</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">api_key</span> <span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"n\">cfg</span><span class=\"p\">[</span><span class=\"s2\">\"api_key\"</span><span class=\"p\">]</span>\n        <span class=\"k\">if</span> <span class=\"ow\">not</span> <span class=\"bp\">self</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">api_key</span><span class=\"p\">:</span>\n            <span class=\"bp\">self</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">_headers</span> <span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"p\">{}</span>\n        <span class=\"k\">elif</span> <span class=\"bp\">self</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">api_key</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">startswith</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"s2\">\"dw_live_\"</span><span class=\"p\">):</span>\n            <span class=\"bp\">self</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">_headers</span> <span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"p\">{</span><span class=\"s2\">\"X-API-KEY\"</span><span class=\"p\">:</span> <span class=\"bp\">self</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">api_key</span><span class=\"p\">}</span>\n        <span class=\"k\">else</span><span class=\"p\">:</span>\n            <span class=\"bp\">self</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">_headers</span> <span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"p\">{</span><span class=\"s2\">\"Authorization\"</span><span class=\"p\">:</span> <span class=\"sa\">f</span><span class=\"s2\">\"Bearer </span><span class=\"si\">{</span><span class=\"bp\">self</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">api_key</span><span class=\"si\">}</span><span class=\"s2\">\"</span><span class=\"p\">}</span>\n\n    <span class=\"c1\"># \u2500\u2500 low-level \u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500</span>\n\n    <span class=\"k\">def</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nf\">_raw_request</span><span class=\"p\">(</span>\n        <span class=\"bp\">self</span><span class=\"p\">,</span>\n        <span class=\"n\">method</span><span class=\"p\">:</span> <span class=\"nb\">str</span><span class=\"p\">,</span>\n        <span class=\"n\">path</span><span class=\"p\">:</span> <span class=\"nb\">str</span><span class=\"p\">,</span>\n        <span class=\"o\">*</span><span class=\"p\">,</span>\n        <span class=\"n\">params</span><span class=\"p\">:</span> <span class=\"n\">Optional</span><span class=\"p\">[</span><span class=\"nb\">dict</span><span class=\"p\">]</span> <span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"kc\">None</span><span class=\"p\">,</span>\n        <span class=\"n\">json</span><span class=\"p\">:</span> <span class=\"n\">Optional</span><span class=\"p\">[</span><span class=\"nb\">dict</span><span class=\"p\">]</span> <span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"kc\">None</span><span class=\"p\">,</span>\n        <span class=\"n\">data</span><span class=\"p\">:</span> <span class=\"n\">Optional</span><span class=\"p\">[</span><span class=\"nb\">dict</span><span class=\"p\">]</span> <span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"kc\">None</span><span class=\"p\">,</span>\n        <span class=\"n\">files</span><span class=\"p\">:</span> <span class=\"n\">Optional</span><span class=\"p\">[</span><span class=\"nb\">dict</span><span class=\"p\">]</span> <span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"kc\">None</span><span class=\"p\">,</span>\n        <span class=\"n\">timeout</span><span class=\"p\">:</span> <span class=\"nb\">float</span> <span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"mi\">60</span><span class=\"p\">,</span>\n    <span class=\"p\">)</span> <span class=\"o\">-&gt;</span> <span class=\"nb\">dict</span><span class=\"p\">:</span>\n<span class=\"w\">        </span><span class=\"sd\">\"\"\"Public low-level HTTP escape hatch for endpoints the SDK doesn't wrap.</span>\n\n<span class=\"sd\">        URLs are joined with ``base_url``; the auth header is injected</span>\n<span class=\"sd\">        automatically.</span>\n\n<span class=\"sd\">        Returns:</span>\n<span class=\"sd\">            Parsed JSON body as dict (or empty dict on 204/empty body).</span>\n<span class=\"sd\">        \"\"\"</span>\n        <span class=\"n\">resp</span> <span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"n\">httpx</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">request</span><span class=\"p\">(</span>\n            <span class=\"n\">method</span><span class=\"p\">,</span>\n            <span class=\"sa\">f</span><span class=\"s2\">\"</span><span class=\"si\">{</span><span class=\"bp\">self</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">base_url</span><span class=\"si\">}{</span><span class=\"n\">path</span><span class=\"si\">}</span><span class=\"s2\">\"</span><span class=\"p\">,</span>\n            <span class=\"n\">params</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"n\">params</span><span class=\"p\">,</span>\n            <span class=\"n\">json</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"n\">json</span><span class=\"p\">,</span>\n            <span class=\"n\">data</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"n\">data</span><span class=\"p\">,</span>\n            <span class=\"n\">files</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"n\">files</span><span class=\"p\">,</span>\n            <span class=\"n\">headers</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"bp\">self</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">_headers</span><span class=\"p\">,</span>\n            <span class=\"n\">timeout</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"n\">timeout</span><span class=\"p\">,</span>\n        <span class=\"p\">)</span>\n        <span class=\"n\">resp</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">raise_for_status</span><span class=\"p\">()</span>\n        <span class=\"k\">if</span> <span class=\"n\">resp</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">status_code</span> <span class=\"o\">==</span> <span class=\"mi\">204</span> <span class=\"ow\">or</span> <span class=\"ow\">not</span> <span class=\"n\">resp</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">content</span><span class=\"p\">:</span>\n            <span class=\"k\">return</span> <span class=\"p\">{}</span>\n        <span class=\"k\">return</span> <span class=\"n\">resp</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">json</span><span class=\"p\">()</span>\n\n    <span class=\"k\">def</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nf\">_ws_url</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"bp\">self</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"n\">path</span><span class=\"p\">:</span> <span class=\"nb\">str</span><span class=\"p\">)</span> <span class=\"o\">-&gt;</span> <span class=\"nb\">str</span><span class=\"p\">:</span>\n        <span class=\"n\">base</span> <span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"bp\">self</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">base_url</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">replace</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"s2\">\"https://\"</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"s2\">\"wss://\"</span><span class=\"p\">)</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">replace</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"s2\">\"http://\"</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"s2\">\"ws://\"</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n        <span class=\"k\">return</span> <span class=\"sa\">f</span><span class=\"s2\">\"</span><span class=\"si\">{</span><span class=\"n\">base</span><span class=\"si\">}{</span><span class=\"n\">path</span><span class=\"si\">}</span><span class=\"s2\">\"</span>\n\n    <span class=\"k\">def</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nf\">_ws_auth_frame</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"bp\">self</span><span class=\"p\">)</span> <span class=\"o\">-&gt;</span> <span class=\"nb\">dict</span><span class=\"p\">:</span>\n        <span class=\"c1\"># dw_live_ keys go in api_key; bearer tokens go in token.</span>\n        <span class=\"k\">if</span> <span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"bp\">self</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">api_key</span> <span class=\"ow\">or</span> <span class=\"s2\">\"\"</span><span class=\"p\">)</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">startswith</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"s2\">\"dw_live_\"</span><span class=\"p\">):</span>\n            <span class=\"k\">return</span> <span class=\"p\">{</span><span class=\"s2\">\"type\"</span><span class=\"p\">:</span> <span class=\"s2\">\"auth\"</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"s2\">\"api_key\"</span><span class=\"p\">:</span> <span class=\"bp\">self</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">api_key</span><span class=\"p\">}</span>\n        <span class=\"k\">return</span> <span class=\"p\">{</span><span class=\"s2\">\"type\"</span><span class=\"p\">:</span> <span class=\"s2\">\"auth\"</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"s2\">\"token\"</span><span class=\"p\">:</span> <span class=\"bp\">self</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">api_key</span><span class=\"p\">}</span>\n\n    <span class=\"c1\"># \u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550</span>\n    <span class=\"c1\"># DOCUMENTS</span>\n    <span class=\"c1\"># \u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550</span>\n\n    <span class=\"nd\">@staticmethod</span>\n    <span class=\"k\">def</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nf\">_read_file</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">file</span><span class=\"p\">:</span> <span class=\"n\">Union</span><span class=\"p\">[</span><span class=\"nb\">str</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"nb\">bytes</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"n\">BinaryIO</span><span class=\"p\">],</span> <span class=\"n\">filename</span><span class=\"p\">:</span> <span class=\"n\">Optional</span><span class=\"p\">[</span><span class=\"nb\">str</span><span class=\"p\">]</span> <span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"kc\">None</span><span class=\"p\">):</span>\n        <span class=\"k\">if</span> <span class=\"nb\">isinstance</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">file</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"nb\">str</span><span class=\"p\">):</span>\n            <span class=\"k\">with</span> <span class=\"nb\">open</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">file</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"s2\">\"rb\"</span><span class=\"p\">)</span> <span class=\"k\">as</span> <span class=\"n\">f</span><span class=\"p\">:</span>\n                <span class=\"n\">content</span> <span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"n\">f</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">read</span><span class=\"p\">()</span>\n            <span class=\"n\">filename</span> <span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"n\">filename</span> <span class=\"ow\">or</span> <span class=\"n\">os</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">path</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">basename</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">file</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n        <span class=\"k\">elif</span> <span class=\"nb\">isinstance</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">file</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"nb\">bytes</span><span class=\"p\">):</span>\n            <span class=\"n\">content</span> <span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"n\">file</span>\n        <span class=\"k\">else</span><span class=\"p\">:</span>\n            <span class=\"n\">content</span> <span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"n\">file</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">read</span><span class=\"p\">()</span>\n            <span class=\"n\">filename</span> <span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"n\">filename</span> <span class=\"ow\">or</span> <span class=\"nb\">getattr</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">file</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"s2\">\"name\"</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"s2\">\"document\"</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n        <span class=\"k\">return</span> <span class=\"n\">content</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"n\">filename</span>\n\n<div class=\"viewcode-block\" id=\"DocWorm.upload\">\n<a class=\"viewcode-back\" href=\"../../../client/#docworm.client.DocWorm.upload\">[docs]</a>\n    <span class=\"k\">def</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nf\">upload</span><span class=\"p\">(</span>\n        <span class=\"bp\">self</span><span class=\"p\">,</span>\n        <span class=\"n\">file</span><span class=\"p\">:</span> <span class=\"n\">Union</span><span class=\"p\">[</span><span class=\"nb\">str</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"nb\">bytes</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"n\">BinaryIO</span><span class=\"p\">],</span>\n        <span class=\"n\">filename</span><span class=\"p\">:</span> <span class=\"n\">Optional</span><span class=\"p\">[</span><span class=\"nb\">str</span><span class=\"p\">]</span> <span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"kc\">None</span><span class=\"p\">,</span>\n        <span class=\"n\">file_id</span><span class=\"p\">:</span> <span class=\"n\">Optional</span><span class=\"p\">[</span><span class=\"nb\">str</span><span class=\"p\">]</span> <span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"kc\">None</span><span class=\"p\">,</span>\n        <span class=\"n\">project_id</span><span class=\"p\">:</span> <span class=\"n\">Optional</span><span class=\"p\">[</span><span class=\"nb\">str</span><span class=\"p\">]</span> <span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"kc\">None</span><span class=\"p\">,</span>\n        <span class=\"n\">chat_id</span><span class=\"p\">:</span> <span class=\"n\">Optional</span><span class=\"p\">[</span><span class=\"nb\">str</span><span class=\"p\">]</span> <span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"kc\">None</span><span class=\"p\">,</span>\n        <span class=\"n\">folder_id</span><span class=\"p\">:</span> <span class=\"n\">Optional</span><span class=\"p\">[</span><span class=\"nb\">str</span><span class=\"p\">]</span> <span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"kc\">None</span><span class=\"p\">,</span>\n    <span class=\"p\">)</span> <span class=\"o\">-&gt;</span> <span class=\"n\">UploadResponse</span><span class=\"p\">:</span>\n<span class=\"w\">        </span><span class=\"sd\">\"\"\"</span>\n<span class=\"sd\">        Upload a document for indexing.</span>\n\n<span class=\"sd\">        Args:</span>\n<span class=\"sd\">            file: File path (str), raw bytes, or file-like object.</span>\n<span class=\"sd\">            filename: Original filename (auto-detected from path if str).</span>\n<span class=\"sd\">            file_id: Optional custom file ID (server generates one otherwise).</span>\n<span class=\"sd\">            project_id, chat_id, folder_id: Optional scoping context.</span>\n\n<span class=\"sd\">        Returns:</span>\n<span class=\"sd\">            UploadResponse with file_id for subsequent indexing.</span>\n<span class=\"sd\">        \"\"\"</span>\n        <span class=\"n\">content</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"n\">filename</span> <span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"bp\">self</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">_read_file</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">file</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"n\">filename</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n        <span class=\"n\">files</span> <span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"p\">{</span><span class=\"s2\">\"file\"</span><span class=\"p\">:</span> <span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">filename</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"n\">content</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"s2\">\"application/octet-stream\"</span><span class=\"p\">)}</span>\n        <span class=\"n\">data</span> <span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"p\">{}</span>\n        <span class=\"k\">if</span> <span class=\"n\">file_id</span><span class=\"p\">:</span>\n            <span class=\"n\">data</span><span class=\"p\">[</span><span class=\"s2\">\"file_id\"</span><span class=\"p\">]</span> <span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"n\">file_id</span>\n        <span class=\"k\">if</span> <span class=\"n\">project_id</span><span class=\"p\">:</span>\n            <span class=\"n\">data</span><span class=\"p\">[</span><span class=\"s2\">\"project_id\"</span><span class=\"p\">]</span> <span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"n\">project_id</span>\n        <span class=\"k\">if</span> <span class=\"n\">chat_id</span><span class=\"p\">:</span>\n            <span class=\"n\">data</span><span class=\"p\">[</span><span class=\"s2\">\"chat_id\"</span><span class=\"p\">]</span> <span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"n\">chat_id</span>\n        <span class=\"k\">if</span> <span class=\"n\">folder_id</span><span class=\"p\">:</span>\n            <span class=\"n\">data</span><span class=\"p\">[</span><span class=\"s2\">\"folder_id\"</span><span class=\"p\">]</span> <span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"n\">folder_id</span>\n\n        <span class=\"n\">resp</span> <span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"n\">httpx</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">post</span><span class=\"p\">(</span>\n            <span class=\"sa\">f</span><span class=\"s2\">\"</span><span class=\"si\">{</span><span class=\"bp\">self</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">base_url</span><span class=\"si\">}</span><span class=\"s2\">/v1/upload\"</span><span class=\"p\">,</span>\n            <span class=\"n\">files</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"n\">files</span><span class=\"p\">,</span>\n            <span class=\"n\">data</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"n\">data</span><span class=\"p\">,</span>\n            <span class=\"n\">headers</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"bp\">self</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">_headers</span><span class=\"p\">,</span>\n            <span class=\"n\">timeout</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"mi\">300</span><span class=\"p\">,</span>\n        <span class=\"p\">)</span>\n        <span class=\"n\">resp</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">raise_for_status</span><span class=\"p\">()</span>\n        <span class=\"n\">d</span> <span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"n\">resp</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">json</span><span class=\"p\">()</span>\n        <span class=\"k\">return</span> <span class=\"n\">UploadResponse</span><span class=\"p\">(</span>\n            <span class=\"n\">status</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"n\">d</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">get</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"s2\">\"status\"</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"s2\">\"\"</span><span class=\"p\">),</span>\n            <span class=\"n\">file_id</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"n\">d</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">get</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"s2\">\"file_id\"</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"s2\">\"\"</span><span class=\"p\">),</span>\n            <span class=\"n\">filename</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"n\">d</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">get</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"s2\">\"filename\"</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"s2\">\"\"</span><span class=\"p\">),</span>\n            <span class=\"n\">gcs_raw_path</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"n\">d</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">get</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"s2\">\"gcs_raw_path\"</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"s2\">\"\"</span><span class=\"p\">),</span>\n        <span class=\"p\">)</span></div>\n\n\n<div class=\"viewcode-block\" id=\"DocWorm.index\">\n<a class=\"viewcode-back\" href=\"../../../client/#docworm.client.DocWorm.index\">[docs]</a>\n    <span class=\"k\">def</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nf\">index</span><span class=\"p\">(</span>\n        <span class=\"bp\">self</span><span class=\"p\">,</span>\n        <span class=\"n\">file_id</span><span class=\"p\">:</span> <span class=\"nb\">str</span><span class=\"p\">,</span>\n        <span class=\"n\">project_id</span><span class=\"p\">:</span> <span class=\"n\">Optional</span><span class=\"p\">[</span><span class=\"nb\">str</span><span class=\"p\">]</span> <span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"kc\">None</span><span class=\"p\">,</span>\n        <span class=\"n\">chat_id</span><span class=\"p\">:</span> <span class=\"n\">Optional</span><span class=\"p\">[</span><span class=\"nb\">str</span><span class=\"p\">]</span> <span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"kc\">None</span><span class=\"p\">,</span>\n        <span class=\"n\">folder_id</span><span class=\"p\">:</span> <span class=\"n\">Optional</span><span class=\"p\">[</span><span class=\"nb\">str</span><span class=\"p\">]</span> <span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"kc\">None</span><span class=\"p\">,</span>\n        <span class=\"n\">file</span><span class=\"p\">:</span> <span class=\"n\">Optional</span><span class=\"p\">[</span><span class=\"n\">Union</span><span class=\"p\">[</span><span class=\"nb\">str</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"nb\">bytes</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"n\">BinaryIO</span><span class=\"p\">]]</span> <span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"kc\">None</span><span class=\"p\">,</span>\n        <span class=\"n\">filename</span><span class=\"p\">:</span> <span class=\"n\">Optional</span><span class=\"p\">[</span><span class=\"nb\">str</span><span class=\"p\">]</span> <span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"kc\">None</span><span class=\"p\">,</span>\n    <span class=\"p\">)</span> <span class=\"o\">-&gt;</span> <span class=\"n\">IndexResponse</span><span class=\"p\">:</span>\n<span class=\"w\">        </span><span class=\"sd\">\"\"\"</span>\n<span class=\"sd\">        Index an already-uploaded document (or upload + index in one step</span>\n<span class=\"sd\">        by passing ``file``).</span>\n\n<span class=\"sd\">        ``file_id`` is sent as a query parameter; the optional scoping</span>\n<span class=\"sd\">        fields are still form fields.</span>\n\n<span class=\"sd\">        Returns:</span>\n<span class=\"sd\">            IndexResponse \u2014 usually ``status=\"queued\"``; poll with</span>\n<span class=\"sd\">            wait_for_indexing() until ready.</span>\n<span class=\"sd\">        \"\"\"</span>\n        <span class=\"n\">params</span> <span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"p\">{</span><span class=\"s2\">\"file_id\"</span><span class=\"p\">:</span> <span class=\"n\">file_id</span><span class=\"p\">}</span>\n        <span class=\"n\">data</span><span class=\"p\">:</span> <span class=\"nb\">dict</span> <span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"p\">{}</span>\n        <span class=\"k\">if</span> <span class=\"n\">project_id</span><span class=\"p\">:</span>\n            <span class=\"n\">data</span><span class=\"p\">[</span><span class=\"s2\">\"project_id\"</span><span class=\"p\">]</span> <span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"n\">project_id</span>\n        <span class=\"k\">if</span> <span class=\"n\">chat_id</span><span class=\"p\">:</span>\n            <span class=\"n\">data</span><span class=\"p\">[</span><span class=\"s2\">\"chat_id\"</span><span class=\"p\">]</span> <span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"n\">chat_id</span>\n        <span class=\"k\">if</span> <span class=\"n\">folder_id</span><span class=\"p\">:</span>\n            <span class=\"n\">data</span><span class=\"p\">[</span><span class=\"s2\">\"folder_id\"</span><span class=\"p\">]</span> <span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"n\">folder_id</span>\n        <span class=\"n\">files</span> <span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"kc\">None</span>\n        <span class=\"k\">if</span> <span class=\"n\">file</span> <span class=\"ow\">is</span> <span class=\"ow\">not</span> <span class=\"kc\">None</span><span class=\"p\">:</span>\n            <span class=\"n\">content</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"n\">filename</span> <span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"bp\">self</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">_read_file</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">file</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"n\">filename</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n            <span class=\"n\">files</span> <span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"p\">{</span><span class=\"s2\">\"file\"</span><span class=\"p\">:</span> <span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">filename</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"n\">content</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"s2\">\"application/octet-stream\"</span><span class=\"p\">)}</span>\n\n        <span class=\"n\">resp</span> <span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"n\">httpx</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">post</span><span class=\"p\">(</span>\n            <span class=\"sa\">f</span><span class=\"s2\">\"</span><span class=\"si\">{</span><span class=\"bp\">self</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">base_url</span><span class=\"si\">}</span><span class=\"s2\">/v1/index\"</span><span class=\"p\">,</span>\n            <span class=\"n\">params</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"n\">params</span><span class=\"p\">,</span>\n            <span class=\"n\">data</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"n\">data</span><span class=\"p\">,</span>\n            <span class=\"n\">files</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"n\">files</span><span class=\"p\">,</span>\n            <span class=\"n\">headers</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"bp\">self</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">_headers</span><span class=\"p\">,</span>\n            <span class=\"n\">timeout</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"mi\">60</span><span class=\"p\">,</span>\n        <span class=\"p\">)</span>\n        <span class=\"n\">resp</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">raise_for_status</span><span class=\"p\">()</span>\n        <span class=\"n\">d</span> <span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"n\">resp</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">json</span><span class=\"p\">()</span>\n        <span class=\"k\">return</span> <span class=\"n\">IndexResponse</span><span class=\"p\">(</span>\n            <span class=\"n\">status</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"n\">d</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">get</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"s2\">\"status\"</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"s2\">\"\"</span><span class=\"p\">),</span>\n            <span class=\"n\">file_id</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"n\">d</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">get</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"s2\">\"file_id\"</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"n\">file_id</span><span class=\"p\">),</span>\n            <span class=\"n\">filename</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"n\">d</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">get</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"s2\">\"filename\"</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"s2\">\"\"</span><span class=\"p\">),</span>\n            <span class=\"n\">total_pages</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"n\">d</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">get</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"s2\">\"total_pages\"</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"mi\">0</span><span class=\"p\">)</span> <span class=\"ow\">or</span> <span class=\"mi\">0</span><span class=\"p\">,</span>\n        <span class=\"p\">)</span></div>\n\n\n<div class=\"viewcode-block\" id=\"DocWorm.upload_and_index\">\n<a class=\"viewcode-back\" href=\"../../../client/#docworm.client.DocWorm.upload_and_index\">[docs]</a>\n    <span class=\"k\">def</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nf\">upload_and_index</span><span class=\"p\">(</span>\n        <span class=\"bp\">self</span><span class=\"p\">,</span>\n        <span class=\"n\">file</span><span class=\"p\">:</span> <span class=\"n\">Union</span><span class=\"p\">[</span><span class=\"nb\">str</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"nb\">bytes</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"n\">BinaryIO</span><span class=\"p\">],</span>\n        <span class=\"n\">filename</span><span class=\"p\">:</span> <span class=\"n\">Optional</span><span class=\"p\">[</span><span class=\"nb\">str</span><span class=\"p\">]</span> <span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"kc\">None</span><span class=\"p\">,</span>\n        <span class=\"n\">file_id</span><span class=\"p\">:</span> <span class=\"n\">Optional</span><span class=\"p\">[</span><span class=\"nb\">str</span><span class=\"p\">]</span> <span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"kc\">None</span><span class=\"p\">,</span>\n        <span class=\"n\">project_id</span><span class=\"p\">:</span> <span class=\"n\">Optional</span><span class=\"p\">[</span><span class=\"nb\">str</span><span class=\"p\">]</span> <span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"kc\">None</span><span class=\"p\">,</span>\n        <span class=\"n\">chat_id</span><span class=\"p\">:</span> <span class=\"n\">Optional</span><span class=\"p\">[</span><span class=\"nb\">str</span><span class=\"p\">]</span> <span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"kc\">None</span><span class=\"p\">,</span>\n        <span class=\"n\">folder_id</span><span class=\"p\">:</span> <span class=\"n\">Optional</span><span class=\"p\">[</span><span class=\"nb\">str</span><span class=\"p\">]</span> <span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"kc\">None</span><span class=\"p\">,</span>\n    <span class=\"p\">)</span> <span class=\"o\">-&gt;</span> <span class=\"n\">IndexResponse</span><span class=\"p\">:</span>\n<span class=\"w\">        </span><span class=\"sd\">\"\"\"</span>\n<span class=\"sd\">        Upload and immediately index a document (convenience method).</span>\n\n<span class=\"sd\">        Returns the queued IndexResponse \u2014 call wait_for_indexing() to</span>\n<span class=\"sd\">        block until the document is ready.</span>\n<span class=\"sd\">        \"\"\"</span>\n        <span class=\"n\">upload_resp</span> <span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"bp\">self</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">upload</span><span class=\"p\">(</span>\n            <span class=\"n\">file</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"n\">filename</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"n\">filename</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"n\">file_id</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"n\">file_id</span><span class=\"p\">,</span>\n            <span class=\"n\">project_id</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"n\">project_id</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"n\">chat_id</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"n\">chat_id</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"n\">folder_id</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"n\">folder_id</span><span class=\"p\">,</span>\n        <span class=\"p\">)</span>\n        <span class=\"k\">return</span> <span class=\"bp\">self</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">index</span><span class=\"p\">(</span>\n            <span class=\"n\">upload_resp</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">file_id</span><span class=\"p\">,</span>\n            <span class=\"n\">project_id</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"n\">project_id</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"n\">chat_id</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"n\">chat_id</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"n\">folder_id</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"n\">folder_id</span><span class=\"p\">,</span>\n        <span class=\"p\">)</span></div>\n\n\n<div class=\"viewcode-block\" id=\"DocWorm.index_json\">\n<a class=\"viewcode-back\" href=\"../../../client/#docworm.client.DocWorm.index_json\">[docs]</a>\n    <span class=\"k\">def</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nf\">index_json</span><span class=\"p\">(</span>\n        <span class=\"bp\">self</span><span class=\"p\">,</span>\n        <span class=\"n\">file_id</span><span class=\"p\">:</span> <span class=\"nb\">str</span><span class=\"p\">,</span>\n        <span class=\"n\">tree</span><span class=\"p\">:</span> <span class=\"nb\">list</span><span class=\"p\">[</span><span class=\"nb\">dict</span><span class=\"p\">],</span>\n        <span class=\"n\">filename</span><span class=\"p\">:</span> <span class=\"nb\">str</span> <span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"s2\">\"document.json\"</span><span class=\"p\">,</span>\n    <span class=\"p\">)</span> <span class=\"o\">-&gt;</span> <span class=\"n\">IndexResponse</span><span class=\"p\">:</span>\n<span class=\"w\">        </span><span class=\"sd\">\"\"\"</span>\n<span class=\"sd\">        Index a pre-built tree JSON directly (programmatic ingestion).</span>\n\n<span class=\"sd\">        Returns:</span>\n<span class=\"sd\">            IndexResponse with status=\"completed\".</span>\n<span class=\"sd\">        \"\"\"</span>\n        <span class=\"n\">resp</span> <span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"n\">httpx</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">post</span><span class=\"p\">(</span>\n            <span class=\"sa\">f</span><span class=\"s2\">\"</span><span class=\"si\">{</span><span class=\"bp\">self</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">base_url</span><span class=\"si\">}</span><span class=\"s2\">/v1/index-json\"</span><span class=\"p\">,</span>\n            <span class=\"n\">json</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"p\">{</span><span class=\"s2\">\"file_id\"</span><span class=\"p\">:</span> <span class=\"n\">file_id</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"s2\">\"filename\"</span><span class=\"p\">:</span> <span class=\"n\">filename</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"s2\">\"tree\"</span><span class=\"p\">:</span> <span class=\"n\">tree</span><span class=\"p\">},</span>\n            <span class=\"n\">headers</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"bp\">self</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">_headers</span><span class=\"p\">,</span>\n            <span class=\"n\">timeout</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"mi\">60</span><span class=\"p\">,</span>\n        <span class=\"p\">)</span>\n        <span class=\"n\">resp</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">raise_for_status</span><span class=\"p\">()</span>\n        <span class=\"n\">d</span> <span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"n\">resp</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">json</span><span class=\"p\">()</span>\n        <span class=\"k\">return</span> <span class=\"n\">IndexResponse</span><span class=\"p\">(</span>\n            <span class=\"n\">status</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"n\">d</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">get</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"s2\">\"status\"</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"s2\">\"\"</span><span class=\"p\">),</span>\n            <span class=\"n\">file_id</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"n\">d</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">get</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"s2\">\"file_id\"</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"n\">file_id</span><span class=\"p\">),</span>\n            <span class=\"n\">filename</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"n\">d</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">get</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"s2\">\"filename\"</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"s2\">\"\"</span><span class=\"p\">),</span>\n            <span class=\"n\">total_pages</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"n\">d</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">get</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"s2\">\"total_pages\"</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"mi\">0</span><span class=\"p\">)</span> <span class=\"ow\">or</span> <span class=\"mi\">0</span><span class=\"p\">,</span>\n        <span class=\"p\">)</span></div>\n\n\n<div class=\"viewcode-block\" id=\"DocWorm.index_batch\">\n<a class=\"viewcode-back\" href=\"../../../client/#docworm.client.DocWorm.index_batch\">[docs]</a>\n    <span class=\"k\">def</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nf\">index_batch</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"bp\">self</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"n\">file_ids</span><span class=\"p\">:</span> <span class=\"nb\">list</span><span class=\"p\">[</span><span class=\"nb\">str</span><span class=\"p\">])</span> <span class=\"o\">-&gt;</span> <span class=\"nb\">dict</span><span class=\"p\">:</span>\n<span class=\"w\">        </span><span class=\"sd\">\"\"\"</span>\n<span class=\"sd\">        Batch reindex up to 100 files (concurrency-gated by plan).</span>\n\n<span class=\"sd\">        Returns:</span>\n<span class=\"sd\">            Dict with queued count, concurrency, and per-file results.</span>\n<span class=\"sd\">        \"\"\"</span>\n        <span class=\"n\">resp</span> <span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"n\">httpx</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">post</span><span class=\"p\">(</span>\n            <span class=\"sa\">f</span><span class=\"s2\">\"</span><span class=\"si\">{</span><span class=\"bp\">self</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">base_url</span><span class=\"si\">}</span><span class=\"s2\">/v1/index/batch\"</span><span class=\"p\">,</span>\n            <span class=\"n\">json</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"p\">{</span><span class=\"s2\">\"file_ids\"</span><span class=\"p\">:</span> <span class=\"n\">file_ids</span><span class=\"p\">},</span>\n            <span class=\"n\">headers</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"bp\">self</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">_headers</span><span class=\"p\">,</span>\n            <span class=\"n\">timeout</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"mi\">60</span><span class=\"p\">,</span>\n        <span class=\"p\">)</span>\n        <span class=\"n\">resp</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">raise_for_status</span><span class=\"p\">()</span>\n        <span class=\"k\">return</span> <span class=\"n\">resp</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">json</span><span class=\"p\">()</span></div>\n\n\n<div class=\"viewcode-block\" id=\"DocWorm.retry_failed_pages\">\n<a class=\"viewcode-back\" href=\"../../../client/#docworm.client.DocWorm.retry_failed_pages\">[docs]</a>\n    <span class=\"k\">def</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nf\">retry_failed_pages</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"bp\">self</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"n\">file_id</span><span class=\"p\">:</span> <span class=\"nb\">str</span><span class=\"p\">)</span> <span class=\"o\">-&gt;</span> <span class=\"nb\">dict</span><span class=\"p\">:</span>\n<span class=\"w\">        </span><span class=\"sd\">\"\"\"</span>\n<span class=\"sd\">        Re-queue only the failed pages of a partial document.</span>\n\n<span class=\"sd\">        Returns:</span>\n<span class=\"sd\">            Dict with retried_pages, enqueued count, and total_pages.</span>\n<span class=\"sd\">        \"\"\"</span>\n        <span class=\"n\">resp</span> <span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"n\">httpx</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">post</span><span class=\"p\">(</span>\n            <span class=\"sa\">f</span><span class=\"s2\">\"</span><span class=\"si\">{</span><span class=\"bp\">self</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">base_url</span><span class=\"si\">}</span><span class=\"s2\">/v1/index/retry-failed\"</span><span class=\"p\">,</span>\n            <span class=\"n\">params</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"p\">{</span><span class=\"s2\">\"file_id\"</span><span class=\"p\">:</span> <span class=\"n\">file_id</span><span class=\"p\">},</span>\n            <span class=\"n\">headers</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"bp\">self</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">_headers</span><span class=\"p\">,</span>\n            <span class=\"n\">timeout</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"mi\">60</span><span class=\"p\">,</span>\n        <span class=\"p\">)</span>\n        <span class=\"n\">resp</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">raise_for_status</span><span class=\"p\">()</span>\n        <span class=\"k\">return</span> <span class=\"n\">resp</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">json</span><span class=\"p\">()</span></div>\n\n\n<div class=\"viewcode-block\" id=\"DocWorm.cancel_indexing\">\n<a class=\"viewcode-back\" href=\"../../../client/#docworm.client.DocWorm.cancel_indexing\">[docs]</a>\n    <span class=\"k\">def</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nf\">cancel_indexing</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"bp\">self</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"n\">file_ids</span><span class=\"p\">:</span> <span class=\"nb\">list</span><span class=\"p\">[</span><span class=\"nb\">str</span><span class=\"p\">])</span> <span class=\"o\">-&gt;</span> <span class=\"nb\">dict</span><span class=\"p\">:</span>\n<span class=\"w\">        </span><span class=\"sd\">\"\"\"</span>\n<span class=\"sd\">        Cancel in-flight indexing tasks for documents.</span>\n\n<span class=\"sd\">        Returns:</span>\n<span class=\"sd\">            Dict with cancelled task count.</span>\n<span class=\"sd\">        \"\"\"</span>\n        <span class=\"n\">resp</span> <span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"n\">httpx</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">post</span><span class=\"p\">(</span>\n            <span class=\"sa\">f</span><span class=\"s2\">\"</span><span class=\"si\">{</span><span class=\"bp\">self</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">base_url</span><span class=\"si\">}</span><span class=\"s2\">/v1/index/cancel\"</span><span class=\"p\">,</span>\n            <span class=\"n\">json</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"p\">{</span><span class=\"s2\">\"file_ids\"</span><span class=\"p\">:</span> <span class=\"n\">file_ids</span><span class=\"p\">},</span>\n            <span class=\"n\">headers</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"bp\">self</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">_headers</span><span class=\"p\">,</span>\n            <span class=\"n\">timeout</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"mi\">30</span><span class=\"p\">,</span>\n        <span class=\"p\">)</span>\n        <span class=\"n\">resp</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">raise_for_status</span><span class=\"p\">()</span>\n        <span class=\"k\">return</span> <span class=\"n\">resp</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">json</span><span class=\"p\">()</span></div>\n\n\n<div class=\"viewcode-block\" id=\"DocWorm.reset_index\">\n<a class=\"viewcode-back\" href=\"../../../client/#docworm.client.DocWorm.reset_index\">[docs]</a>\n    <span class=\"k\">def</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nf\">reset_index</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"bp\">self</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"n\">file_id</span><span class=\"p\">:</span> <span class=\"nb\">str</span><span class=\"p\">)</span> <span class=\"o\">-&gt;</span> <span class=\"nb\">dict</span><span class=\"p\">:</span>\n<span class=\"w\">        </span><span class=\"sd\">\"\"\"</span>\n<span class=\"sd\">        Wipe derived state for a doc without uploading new bytes</span>\n<span class=\"sd\">        (used by the replace flow).</span>\n\n<span class=\"sd\">        Returns:</span>\n<span class=\"sd\">            Dict with reset bool.</span>\n<span class=\"sd\">        \"\"\"</span>\n        <span class=\"n\">resp</span> <span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"n\">httpx</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">post</span><span class=\"p\">(</span>\n            <span class=\"sa\">f</span><span class=\"s2\">\"</span><span class=\"si\">{</span><span class=\"bp\">self</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">base_url</span><span class=\"si\">}</span><span class=\"s2\">/v1/reset_index\"</span><span class=\"p\">,</span>\n            <span class=\"n\">params</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"p\">{</span><span class=\"s2\">\"file_id\"</span><span class=\"p\">:</span> <span class=\"n\">file_id</span><span class=\"p\">},</span>\n            <span class=\"n\">headers</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"bp\">self</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">_headers</span><span class=\"p\">,</span>\n            <span class=\"n\">timeout</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"mi\">30</span><span class=\"p\">,</span>\n        <span class=\"p\">)</span>\n        <span class=\"n\">resp</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">raise_for_status</span><span class=\"p\">()</span>\n        <span class=\"k\">return</span> <span class=\"n\">resp</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">json</span><span class=\"p\">()</span></div>\n\n\n<div class=\"viewcode-block\" id=\"DocWorm.list_documents\">\n<a class=\"viewcode-back\" href=\"../../../client/#docworm.client.DocWorm.list_documents\">[docs]</a>\n    <span class=\"k\">def</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nf\">list_documents</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"bp\">self</span><span class=\"p\">)</span> <span class=\"o\">-&gt;</span> <span class=\"nb\">list</span><span class=\"p\">[</span><span class=\"nb\">dict</span><span class=\"p\">]:</span>\n<span class=\"w\">        </span><span class=\"sd\">\"\"\"List all documents for the authenticated user.\"\"\"</span>\n        <span class=\"n\">resp</span> <span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"n\">httpx</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">get</span><span class=\"p\">(</span>\n            <span class=\"sa\">f</span><span class=\"s2\">\"</span><span class=\"si\">{</span><span class=\"bp\">self</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">base_url</span><span class=\"si\">}</span><span class=\"s2\">/v1/documents\"</span><span class=\"p\">,</span>\n            <span class=\"n\">headers</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"bp\">self</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">_headers</span><span class=\"p\">,</span>\n            <span class=\"n\">timeout</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"mi\">30</span><span class=\"p\">,</span>\n        <span class=\"p\">)</span>\n        <span class=\"n\">resp</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">raise_for_status</span><span class=\"p\">()</span>\n        <span class=\"k\">return</span> <span class=\"n\">resp</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">json</span><span class=\"p\">()</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">get</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"s2\">\"documents\"</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"p\">[])</span></div>\n\n\n<div class=\"viewcode-block\" id=\"DocWorm.get_document_status\">\n<a class=\"viewcode-back\" href=\"../../../client/#docworm.client.DocWorm.get_document_status\">[docs]</a>\n    <span class=\"k\">def</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nf\">get_document_status</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"bp\">self</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"n\">file_id</span><span class=\"p\">:</span> <span class=\"nb\">str</span><span class=\"p\">)</span> <span class=\"o\">-&gt;</span> <span class=\"n\">DocumentStatus</span><span class=\"p\">:</span>\n<span class=\"w\">        </span><span class=\"sd\">\"\"\"</span>\n<span class=\"sd\">        Get the indexing status and progress of a document.</span>\n<span class=\"sd\">        \"\"\"</span>\n        <span class=\"n\">resp</span> <span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"n\">httpx</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">get</span><span class=\"p\">(</span>\n            <span class=\"sa\">f</span><span class=\"s2\">\"</span><span class=\"si\">{</span><span class=\"bp\">self</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">base_url</span><span class=\"si\">}</span><span class=\"s2\">/v1/documents/</span><span class=\"si\">{</span><span class=\"n\">quote</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">file_id</span><span class=\"p\">)</span><span class=\"si\">}</span><span class=\"s2\">/status\"</span><span class=\"p\">,</span>\n            <span class=\"n\">headers</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"bp\">self</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">_headers</span><span class=\"p\">,</span>\n            <span class=\"n\">timeout</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"mi\">30</span><span class=\"p\">,</span>\n        <span class=\"p\">)</span>\n        <span class=\"n\">resp</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">raise_for_status</span><span class=\"p\">()</span>\n        <span class=\"k\">return</span> <span class=\"n\">document_status_from_dict</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">resp</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">json</span><span class=\"p\">())</span></div>\n\n\n<div class=\"viewcode-block\" id=\"DocWorm.wait_for_indexing\">\n<a class=\"viewcode-back\" href=\"../../../client/#docworm.client.DocWorm.wait_for_indexing\">[docs]</a>\n    <span class=\"k\">def</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nf\">wait_for_indexing</span><span class=\"p\">(</span>\n        <span class=\"bp\">self</span><span class=\"p\">,</span>\n        <span class=\"n\">file_id</span><span class=\"p\">:</span> <span class=\"nb\">str</span><span class=\"p\">,</span>\n        <span class=\"n\">timeout</span><span class=\"p\">:</span> <span class=\"nb\">float</span> <span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"mi\">600</span><span class=\"p\">,</span>\n        <span class=\"n\">poll_interval</span><span class=\"p\">:</span> <span class=\"nb\">float</span> <span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"mi\">5</span><span class=\"p\">,</span>\n    <span class=\"p\">)</span> <span class=\"o\">-&gt;</span> <span class=\"n\">DocumentStatus</span><span class=\"p\">:</span>\n<span class=\"w\">        </span><span class=\"sd\">\"\"\"</span>\n<span class=\"sd\">        Poll until document indexing completes or times out.</span>\n\n<span class=\"sd\">        Raises:</span>\n<span class=\"sd\">            RuntimeError: If indexing fails or is cancelled.</span>\n<span class=\"sd\">            TimeoutError: If indexing doesn't complete in time.</span>\n<span class=\"sd\">        \"\"\"</span>\n        <span class=\"kn\">import</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">time</span>\n\n        <span class=\"n\">deadline</span> <span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"n\">time</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">time</span><span class=\"p\">()</span> <span class=\"o\">+</span> <span class=\"n\">timeout</span>\n        <span class=\"k\">while</span> <span class=\"n\">time</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">time</span><span class=\"p\">()</span> <span class=\"o\">&lt;</span> <span class=\"n\">deadline</span><span class=\"p\">:</span>\n            <span class=\"n\">status</span> <span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"bp\">self</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">get_document_status</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">file_id</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n            <span class=\"k\">if</span> <span class=\"n\">status</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">ready</span> <span class=\"ow\">or</span> <span class=\"n\">status</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">status</span> <span class=\"ow\">in</span> <span class=\"n\">_SUCCESS_STATUSES</span><span class=\"p\">:</span>\n                <span class=\"k\">return</span> <span class=\"n\">status</span>\n            <span class=\"k\">if</span> <span class=\"n\">status</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">status</span> <span class=\"ow\">in</span> <span class=\"n\">_FAILED_STATUSES</span><span class=\"p\">:</span>\n                <span class=\"k\">raise</span> <span class=\"ne\">RuntimeError</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"sa\">f</span><span class=\"s2\">\"Indexing </span><span class=\"si\">{</span><span class=\"n\">status</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">status</span><span class=\"si\">}</span><span class=\"s2\">: </span><span class=\"si\">{</span><span class=\"n\">status</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">error</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"ow\">or</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">file_id</span><span class=\"si\">}</span><span class=\"s2\">\"</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n            <span class=\"n\">time</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">sleep</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">poll_interval</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n        <span class=\"k\">raise</span> <span class=\"ne\">TimeoutError</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"sa\">f</span><span class=\"s2\">\"Indexing not complete after </span><span class=\"si\">{</span><span class=\"n\">timeout</span><span class=\"si\">}</span><span class=\"s2\">s\"</span><span class=\"p\">)</span></div>\n\n\n<div class=\"viewcode-block\" id=\"DocWorm.get_document_pages\">\n<a class=\"viewcode-back\" href=\"../../../client/#docworm.client.DocWorm.get_document_pages\">[docs]</a>\n    <span class=\"k\">def</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nf\">get_document_pages</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"bp\">self</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"n\">file_id</span><span class=\"p\">:</span> <span class=\"nb\">str</span><span class=\"p\">)</span> <span class=\"o\">-&gt;</span> <span class=\"nb\">list</span><span class=\"p\">[</span><span class=\"n\">PageInfo</span><span class=\"p\">]:</span>\n<span class=\"w\">        </span><span class=\"sd\">\"\"\"</span>\n<span class=\"sd\">        List all pages of a document with their extraction status.</span>\n<span class=\"sd\">        \"\"\"</span>\n        <span class=\"n\">resp</span> <span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"n\">httpx</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">get</span><span class=\"p\">(</span>\n            <span class=\"sa\">f</span><span class=\"s2\">\"</span><span class=\"si\">{</span><span class=\"bp\">self</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">base_url</span><span class=\"si\">}</span><span class=\"s2\">/v1/documents/</span><span class=\"si\">{</span><span class=\"n\">quote</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">file_id</span><span class=\"p\">)</span><span class=\"si\">}</span><span class=\"s2\">/pages\"</span><span class=\"p\">,</span>\n            <span class=\"n\">headers</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"bp\">self</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">_headers</span><span class=\"p\">,</span>\n            <span class=\"