ass=\"sd\">\"\"\"</span>\n<span class=\"sd\">        Prepare a user message for retry. Call before opening a</span>\n<span class=\"sd\">        WS retry stream with parent_msg_id/retry_msg_id.</span>\n<span class=\"sd\">        \"\"\"</span>\n        <span class=\"n\">resp</span> <span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"n\">httpx</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">post</span><span class=\"p\">(</span>\n            <span class=\"sa\">f</span><span class=\"s2\">\"</span><span class=\"si\">{</span><span class=\"bp\">self</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">base_url</span><span class=\"si\">}</span><span class=\"s2\">/v1/chats/</span><span class=\"si\">{</span><span class=\"n\">quote</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">chat_id</span><span class=\"p\">)</span><span class=\"si\">}</span><span class=\"s2\">/messages/</span><span class=\"si\">{</span><span class=\"n\">quote</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">msg_id</span><span class=\"p\">)</span><span class=\"si\">}</span><span class=\"s2\">/retry\"</span><span class=\"p\">,</span>\n            <span class=\"n\">json</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"p\">{</span><span class=\"s2\">\"message\"</span><span class=\"p\">:</span> <span class=\"n\">message</span><span class=\"p\">}</span> <span class=\"k\">if</span> <span class=\"n\">message</span> <span class=\"k\">else</span> <span class=\"p\">{},</span>\n            <span class=\"n\">headers</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"bp\">self</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">_headers</span><span class=\"p\">,</span>\n            <span class=\"n\">timeout</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"mi\">30</span><span class=\"p\">,</span>\n        <span class=\"p\">)</span>\n        <span class=\"n\">resp</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">raise_for_status</span><span class=\"p\">()</span>\n        <span class=\"k\">return</span> <span class=\"n\">resp</span><span class=